On Sat, Feb 28, 2009 at 01:24:01PM -0600, Dustin Marquess wrote:
> If I want to use RAIDframe in a RAID-1 setup, do I change the root
> setting from sd0 to raid0?

Yes - but you could also stay with GENERIC then and just set the raid set to
autoconfigure as root (raidctl -A root ...) - this will override the wildcard
root device selection.

Martin


